{"3881910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "THE FORMIO PROGRAM", "steam_appid": 3881910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>🛰 Coming 2027 – Add to your Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help us reach more players and stay informed about updates, the demo, and upcoming events.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/72118d63a8665a3ada833781b293d2ee.avif?t=1763546209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras_big/72118d63a8665a3ada833781b293d2ee.avif?t=1763546209 width=1600 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up once more, Operator P235. The program still requires your participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a puzzle game where every element is part of <strong>a complex and surprising global system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through the veil of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/62faa0d436c9606e543a28705ba563d8.poster.avif?t=1763546209\" width=1170 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/62faa0d436c9606e543a28705ba563d8.webm?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/62faa0d436c9606e543a28705ba563d8.mp4?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each puzzle is connected to the others in a mind-bending global system</strong>. A text-based game on your computer that influences your reality. Encoded glyphs unlock secret hatches. A hidden observer in the storm. Tokens unlock overpowering features. A virtual companion that grows. And much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing puzzles that will surprise you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is part of a clever global system.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all 6 TOKENS and master the system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/e2f3ad90ca3f5c84d4e5f9683d56c44d.poster.avif?t=1763546209\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/e2f3ad90ca3f5c84d4e5f9683d56c44d.webm?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/e2f3ad90ca3f5c84d4e5f9683d56c44d.mp4?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/448d6b20e196721a71bcbb17b37f5de6.poster.avif?t=1763546209\" width=1170 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/448d6b20e196721a71bcbb17b37f5de6.webm?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/448d6b20e196721a71bcbb17b37f5de6.mp4?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each day, the same sequence repeats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same strange events unfold around you every day.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to understand the meaning of the program.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different realities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/1e3ec5332d4499d17ad23db3dfda5820.poster.avif?t=1763546209\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/1e3ec5332d4499d17ad23db3dfda5820.webm?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/1e3ec5332d4499d17ad23db3dfda5820.mp4?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/7f20fc94e53a4e83943db6192af3df4b.poster.avif?t=1763546209\" width=1170 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/7f20fc94e53a4e83943db6192af3df4b.webm?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881910/extras/7f20fc94e53a4e83943db6192af3df4b.mp4?t=1763546209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate devices and software, connect them together to interact with a realistic ecosystem.</strong> Connect to satellites or servers, hack computers to explore their contents, manage energy distribution, install modules to unlock powerful features, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to us